  "summary": "The Nick Xenophon Team senator Skye Kakoschke-Moore has announced her resignation from the Senate because she has discovered she holds dual British citizenship through her mother, who was born in Singapore, a former British colony. Kakoschke-Moore said she was 'heartbroken' to discover this and described it as 'extremely surprising' as she had always believed she was not British. She will request the matter be referred to the High Court to determine how the vacancy will be filled, and says she will continue to run for the NXT party, with the hope of returning to the Senate. Xenophon, the leader of the NXT party, has expressed his devastation at the loss of Kakoschke-Moore from the Senate, but predicts it is 'not the end of her political career'. He also suggests the position may not be filled by a recount, as the situation is 'uncharted legal territory' due to a recent High Court decision."
